## Import

Import an existing file by path:

```shell
terraform import host_file.gitconfig '~/.gitconfig'
```

A path-only import adopts the existing file in whole-file `content` mode and
does not infer named block ownership. Configure the `block` layout and import
any `host_file_block` resources separately when retaining block-managed state.

